From 242fbf325a105ad478e84107f9900eda225ef3e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:22:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Priorities: PrioritiesPage is the page's container, its
 writes and overlays through PrioritiesPageContext

PriorityMatrixPage becomes PrioritiesPage and absorbs PrioritiesScreen
(the shared header); the route shapes its props with the pure adapter
toPrioritiesPageProps, which also takes the inline current-ISO-week
fallback. PrioritiesPageContext carries activePlanId, the open popover,
the sheet and add-modal openers and the track / complete writes, so
QuadrantCell, MatrixTaskCard, MoveToPopover, MoveToRows,
MobileMoveToSheet and MobileMoveToPanel only take their task data.

groupTasksByQuadrant and isTrackedTask (utils/oneOffUtils.ts, with
FALLBACK_QUADRANT moved beside them) replace the container's grouping
memo and the two inline tracked checks; all three helpers are
unit-tested. The priorities scenarios render PrioritiesPage through the
adapter; the mobile Move-to panel and the MatrixTaskCard specimens render
inside inertPrioritiesPageContext, a card being tracked when its planId
is the context's plan.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KCt6pK3LZBUahDFNY2DecX
